From b06c375d9497ecbd4f8782a9b88fe99fb50f3d5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Usty <usty@uase.tech>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 08:04:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: wire hide/unhide/mute/unmute into the Super Admin
 car list (item 9 part 2, complete)

Final piece connecting everything built in the previous two commits
- passes the new handler props into both CarCard render call sites
on this page (the flat paginated view and the grouped-by-dealer
view), so every listing everywhere on this page now has real,
working HIDE/UNHIDE and MUTE/UNMUTE buttons alongside DELETE.

Item 9 is now fully complete: same card display with icons (part 1),
plus real moderation power - delete, hide/unhide with a note routed
to the dealer's notifications, and mute/unmute for comments (part 2).
Item 11 is also complete for cars specifically, matching what
already existed for dealer-level suspend/warn.
